// Affinity-tier stat payoff (P2 "the world is a resource"): every tier of an
// affinity you have drained buffs YOUR produced units of that affinity, so
// deepening a drain pays off in combat — not just in unlocks. Applied per tier
// above 0 (tier 2 = double the tier-1 bonus), on the unit's OWN affinity (the
// one it is gated on). Player units only — enemies never run an economy, so
// never benefit. Conservative so the army grows without snowballing away the
// "outnumbered" pillar. All [TUNE].
(
    hp_frac_per_tier: 0.06,
    damage_frac_per_tier: 0.06,
)
